   <section xml:id=3D"section-pro-sumti">
     <title>Pro-sumti summary</title>
     <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>pro-sumti</primar=
y><secondary>classes of</secondary></indexterm> The Lojban pro-sumti are th=
e cmavo of selma'o KOhA. They fall into several classes: personal, definabl=
