     <xref linkend=3D"chapter-anaphoric-cmavo"/>; this section mostly dupli=
cates information found there, but adds material on the implicit quantifier=
 of each pro-sumti.</para>
     <para><indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>pro-sumti</primary=
><secondary>implicit quantifier for</secondary></indexterm> The following e=
xamples illustrate each of the classes. Unless otherwise noted below, the i=
mplicit quantification for pro-sumti is=20
